<title>USA: Vivra Inc Q4 net, share rise.</title>
<headline>Vivra Inc Q4 net, share rise.</headline>
<dateline>SAN MATEO, Calif. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>			    Three Months Ended  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>				   November 30,	  November 30,</p>
<p>				 1996	   1995     1996	1995</p>
<p>Revenues</p>
<p> Operating revenues   $142,202    $ 98,683 $506,590  $380,826</p>
<p> Other income		2,576     (1,144)   10,719     5,221</p>
<p> Total revenues	  144,778	97,539  517,309   386,047</p>
<p>Costs and Expenses</p>
<p> Operating		 101,191	69,314  360,500   260,838</p>
<p>General &amp;</p>
<p>  administrative	  15,742	10,136   57,775    50,107</p>
<p> Depreciation		3,915	 3,105   14,170    11,280</p>
<p> Interest		    2,309	    73    3,692	 483</p>
<p>Total Costs and</p>
<p>    Expenses	     123,157	82,628  436,137   322,708</p>
<p>Earnings from continuing</p>
<p>operations, before</p>
<p>minority interest and</p>
<p>   income taxes	   21,621	14,911   81,172    63,339</p>
<p> Minority interest	  (45)	   299    (112)	(95)</p>
