<p>Earnings per Share:</p>
<p>   Net Earnings		.34	   .24     1.27	1.03</p>
<p>Average number of</p>
<p>   Common Shares	  40,181	38,883   39,708    37,350</p>
<p>NOTES: Due to the materiality of pooling-of-interests transactions completed in 1996, the company's annual results and comparative historical results have been restated as if the combinations had been completed as of the beginning of 1995.</p>
<p>Before special charges of $0.04 recorded in the fourth quarter of 1995, earnings per share growth was 21 percent and 19 percent compared with the prior year's periods. Also, the company established a $725,000 litigation reserve in the Q4 1996 reducing reported earnings per share by $0.01. The 1996 statements also included $880,000 of pooling-of-interests costs compared with $70,000 in 1995.</p>
